[[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752967\">5530B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752966\">5530B52</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the spark plug electrical connections (1a), and the\nignition coil electrical connection (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A30A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A30B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove ignition coil (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046942.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the ignition coil in its seating and\ntighten its fixing bolts.</p><p>Connect the ignition coil&#x27;s electrical\nconnection..</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A30A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A30B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the spark plugs&#x27; electrical connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752966\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752967\">5530B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p>"]]